ft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123932","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123932.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123932.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCloses #123918.\r\n\r\nConsider this code:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar test = 1\r\nprint(\"test\")\r\n\r\nvar data = {\"test\": 42}\r\nprint(data[\"test\"])\r\n```\r\n\r\nCtrl+clicking on the `\"test\"` string jumps to the `test` variable because the string is incorrectly recognized as a symbol. The issue reports this behavior in call arguments, including the `[]` operator.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI removed `case GDScriptParser::COMPLETION_CALL_ARGUMENTS:` from the `lookup_code()` function.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123932/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}